    <item>
      <title>Home</title>
      <link>https://hiseashipping.com/home/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 11 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <dc:creator><![CDATA[admin]]></dc:creator>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://hiseashipping.com/?page_id=1</guid>
      <description></description>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<h1>International Shipping and Freight Forwarding</h1>
<p>Hi Sea Shipping offers a complete range of integrated global logistics solutions: Import and Export services via air, land and sea freight, door to door cross border delivery, warehousing and distribution, and packing and relocation.</p>

<h2>Our Services — Booking our cargo to the future</h2>
<ul>
  <li><strong>Sea Freight</strong> — One stop logistical solution for all types of cargo movement by sea.</li>
  <li><strong>Air Freight</strong> — Full range of services for all kinds of air shipments.</li>
  <li><strong>Land Freight</strong> — Overland transportation covering all destinations, with a well-established network of operations.</li>
  <li><strong>Warehousing</strong> — Excellent Warehousing and Distribution Services, with a dedicated spacious warehouse in Karachi.</li>
  <li><strong>Cargo Management</strong> — Project Cargo Services, including planning and scheduling the movement of project and over-dimensional cargo.</li>
  <li><strong>Movers and Packers</strong> — Packing, local movement, wooden ply boxes, wooden crates, wooden pallets and household shipments.</li>
  <li><strong>Customs Clearance</strong> — Customs Clearance Services for Export and Import consignments.</li>
  <li><strong>Door to Door</strong> — Inland point delivery up to the consignee door, with close co-ordination with overseas agent partners.</li>
</ul>

<h2>Why to Choose Us — Thinking the way forward</h2>
<p>Our purpose is to establish psychological proximity of our customer with maximum satisfaction. We strive to build relationship based on mutual trust, respect and transparency. Our focus would be to spread the vicinity of our well trusted brand values globally by enhancing our goodwill and reputation.</p>
<ul>
  <li>Goods Packaging</li>
  <li>Destination Possibilities</li>
  <li>Goods Tracking System</li>
  <li>High Protection</li>
</ul>

<h2>What Our Clients Say — All what customers said about us</h2>
<blockquote>“Best shipping service anyone can provide out of Pakistan for furniture and other products.” — Babar Nawaz</blockquote>
<blockquote>“Superb, Efficient and Excellent Service Providers..” — Deep Sea Love</blockquote>
]]></content:encoded>
