    <item>
      <title>About Us</title>
      <link>https://hiseashipping.com/about/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 11 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <dc:creator><![CDATA[admin]]></dc:creator>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://hiseashipping.com/?page_id=2</guid>
      <description></description>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<h1>About Us — Booking our cargo to the future</h1>
<p>Hi Sea Shipping is an international Shipping and Freight Forwarding company that offers a complete range shipping services like sea freight, air freight and land freight, Packing, Relocation, Warehousing and Custom brokerage, by providing the highest levels of customer satisfaction to our customers.</p>
<p>Hi Sea Shipping is led by industry experts who are having rich experience in the field of shipping and logistics for 2 decades and working towards excellence, and we pride ourselves as leading service provider to meet challenges and perfection at work. By keeping relation with multiple carriers, we can provide the solution to any shipping requirement and serve as one window operation for all products moving through your supply chain. We have access to very competitive rates, which are fair and are constantly revised to reflect industry conditions.</p>

<h2>Mission and Vision [DRAFT — friend to approve]</h2>
<h3>Our Mission</h3>
<p>To establish psychological proximity of our customer with maximum satisfaction, and to build relationships based on mutual trust, respect and transparency, while upholding high professional standards relating to service performance and commitment to satisfaction.</p>
<h3>Our Vision</h3>
<p>To spread the vicinity of our well trusted brand values globally by enhancing our goodwill and reputation, catering to the most usual trade lanes in and out of Pakistan.</p>

<h2>Our Strength</h2>
<p>As Shipping and Forwarding Agent, we assure to provide our clients with the safe transportation of goods from one place to another.</p>
<p>At Hi Sea Shipping we believe our customers are important and part of our business and our objective is to provide Quality Shipping Solutions across UAE and Abroad. By maintaining a friendly and professional approach in our services, our customized solutions have always had proactive methods besides being highly cost effective and competitive in the logistics scenario.</p>

<h2>Why to Choose Us</h2>
<ul>
  <li>Goods Packaging</li>
  <li>Destination Possibilities</li>
  <li>Goods Tracking System</li>
  <li>High Protection</li>
</ul>
]]></content:encoded>
