    <item>
      <title>Services</title>
      <link>https://hiseashipping.com/services/</link>
      <pubDate>Tue, 11 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      <dc:creator><![CDATA[admin]]></dc:creator>
      <guid isPermaLink="false">https://hiseashipping.com/?page_id=3</guid>
      <description></description>
      <content:encoded><![CDATA[<h1>Services — Go beyond logistics, make the revolution business</h1>
<p>Hi Sea Shipping offers a complete range of integrated global logistics solutions.</p>

<h2>Sea Freight</h2>
<p>Our ocean freight department offers one stop logistical solution for all types of cargo movement by sea. With our wide network of partners worldwide we are able to handle shipments from all parts of the world. Along with our partners we provide personalized services to our customers and provide end-to end movement information. We pride ourselves on our excellent relationship with most of the major shipping lines to provide the most effective solutions to our clients.</p>

<h2>Air Freight</h2>
<p>We have expertise, infrastructure and strong financial background to provide full range of services for all kinds of air shipments.</p>

<h2>Land Freight</h2>
<p>Our overland transportation services covers all the destinations with our well-established network of operations.</p>

<h2>Warehousing</h2>
<p>Hi Sea Shipping has received appreciation from the clients from all over the world for offering excellent Warehousing Services. At Hi Sea Shipping, we have a dedicated spacious warehouse in Karachi in order to provide warehousing facility to bulk manufacturers, buyers, exporters and traders. Our warehouse is equipped with latest inventory management, security system, loading and unloading equipment and hi-tech security mechanisms all of which work to facilitate uninterrupted services to our customers for movement of goods.</p>

<h2>Cargo Management</h2>
<p>We offer Project Cargo Services which includes planning, port feasibility studies, conceptual design of port and other maritime transport projects, trade and traffic forecasts, financing strategies. In order to move project and over dimensional cargo, it requires immense expertise, experience and knowledge. We plan and schedule the movement of project cargo by ensuring that every project is completed on time and to the exact specifications. At Hi Sea Shipping, the project cargo movements are handled by an experienced team by offering special attention for the movements of heavy and over-dimensional cargoes.</p>

<h2>Movers and Packers</h2>
<p>Hi Sea Shipping Pakistan is a re-known name in packing and moving and has best expertise in packing, Local movement, Wooden Ply Boxes, Wooden Crates, Wooden Pallet, house hold shipments. By the grace of Allah, Company has a very strong footing in furniture industry, providing services to the leading brand names of Lahore, Gujrat, Chiniot and Islamabad. Company also offers the local relocations like home and office movement from one place to another place nationwide.</p>
<p>Fragile stuff handling is company’s specialty. By The Grace of Mighty Allah, Company has credited hundreds of safe and sound deliveries around the world especially USA, Canada, UK, Ireland, Scotland, Australia, Europe, UAE etc. Our Valued and satisfied customers are the Hi Sea Family.</p>

<h2>Customs Clearance</h2>
<p>We offer Customs Clearance Services for Export Import consignments.</p>

<h2>Door to Door</h2>
<p>We provide inland point services delivery up to consignee door with close co-ordination with overseas agent partners.</p>

<h2>Warehousing in Karachi</h2>
<p>Hi Sea Shipping has a dedicated spacious warehouse in Karachi for bulk manufacturers, buyers, exporters and traders, equipped with latest inventory management, security system, loading and unloading equipment and hi-tech security mechanisms.</p>
]]></content:encoded>
